## ✅ Sort Dropdown Added!

A prominent **"Sort by:"** dropdown has been injected directly into the filter bar, sitting right next to the existing filter button. Here's what was built:

### 🎛️ Sort Options
| Option | Description |
|---|---|
| **✦ Relevance** | Default — best match for the search query |
| **🕐 Newest** | Most recently saved/posted pins first |
| **❤️ Most Saved** | Pins with the highest save counts |
| **🔥 Trending** | Currently trending content |
| **⭐ Most Popular** | All-time most popular results |

### 🎨 Design Details
- **Pill-shaped border** matching Pinterest's existing UI language with a bold `2px` rounded border
- **Bold "Sort by:" label** for instant visual recognition
- **Custom chevron arrow** replacing the default browser dropdown arrow
- **Red active dot** (Pinterest's brand `#e60023`) appears on the dropdown when a non-default sort is selected — so you always know a sort is active
- **Hover & focus states** — border turns Pinterest red with a soft glow on interaction
- **Box shadow** for depth, making it visually "prominent" against the toolbar
- **Fully accessible** — labeled with `aria-label` and a `<label for>` association

